  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civicus: Civil Society and citizen action to enhance civic and democratic spaces</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s overall goal is to strengthen civil society and citizen action for expanded civic and democratic spaces, by strengthening discourse on civic
space and reinforce civil society narratives, building counter power with the most affected groups and their movements, and contributing to stronger ecosystems 
of solidarity and support for activitsts and organisations at risk.</narrative>
  </description>
